      "repair_reason": "- [P2] Human review is needed for the Ollama endpoint compatibility choice; there is no narrow automation repair until maintainers accept or redirect the validator.; Cleared: The diff sends the existing Ollama bearer token only to a same-domain HTTPS endpoint by default, rejects cross-origin custom validation URLs, and does not change dependencies, scripts, permissions, storage, or... (sha=a626d2460d1c11509bbec8edbc9f5127e3eccc37)",
      "review_summary": "The branch adds an Ollama API-key validation POST to `/api/web_search` before fetching `/api/tags`, extends retry-mapping tests, updates Ollama docs, and adds a changelog note.\n\nReproducibility: yes. from source: current main sends the bearer token to `/api/tags` and accepts HTTP 200 as success. I did not run a live provider probe because repository policy discourages unrequested live provider checks.",
